WEBVTT

00:11.490 --> 00:13.760
KINGDOM OF FALMUTH, NIDOL MIGAM EARLDOM
This land will surely become

00:13.760 --> 00:16.040
KINGDOM OF FALMUTH, NIDOL MIGAM EARLDOM
the eye of the storm before long.

00:16.040 --> 00:18.500
"The Champion Youm
and the old king Edmaris

00:18.930 --> 00:22.250
embezzled the reparation funds
meant for Demon Lord Rimuru."

00:22.250 --> 00:25.860
Upon hearing that report,
Falmuth's upper class was infuriated.

00:26.590 --> 00:29.470
Answering to the public will
to take down Edmaris...

00:29.470 --> 00:32.810
The new king Edward
deployed his troops.

00:34.010 --> 00:35.310
But of course,

00:35.310 --> 00:40.020
Youm and Edmaris would never
accept that false report.

00:40.810 --> 00:45.780
Furthermore, Youm had already received
reinforcements from Demon Lord Rimuru.

00:46.360 --> 00:50.030
A war will inevitably occur here.

00:51.030 --> 00:55.620
So Demon Lord Rimuru didn't abandon
the Champion Youm after all.

00:55.620 --> 00:57.660
How naive of him.
Too naive.

00:58.250 --> 01:00.920
Hinata likely already knows
I lied to her by now.

01:01.790 --> 01:04.630
I was hoping to eliminate her here,

01:04.630 --> 01:07.210
but perhaps it is wiser
to pull back now.

01:07.210 --> 01:11.050
It's not like this mission
he gave me ended in failure.

01:11.050 --> 01:12.430
Oh well.

01:13.260 --> 01:16.140
The problem now is my unfinished business.

01:16.140 --> 01:20.020
Taking down the demon
who killed Sir Reyhiem, right, sir?

01:20.020 --> 01:21.810
The Five Elders is asking a lot from you.

01:23.150 --> 01:24.560
Sir Damrada?

01:24.560 --> 01:26.980
There's something
that caught my attention.

01:26.980 --> 01:30.780
They say Majin Razen was serving
the demon in question.

01:31.780 --> 01:35.070
If it's a demon
who can defeat Razen,

01:35.070 --> 01:37.370
it can't be just any ordinary Arch Demon.

01:38.080 --> 01:42.540
Has an older, much worse
demon been revived?

01:42.910 --> 01:44.170
There's nothing we can do.

01:44.170 --> 01:47.170
We will leave an observer behind
and leave this nation.

01:47.170 --> 01:47.920
Yes, sir.

01:48.300 --> 01:52.050
Then what should we do with the demon hunters
we brought over from our homeland?

01:52.470 --> 01:54.930
We'll leave them here as a souvenir
for the new king.

01:54.930 --> 01:59.020
So we'll push the demon problem
to King Edward?

01:59.020 --> 02:00.510
Understood.

02:07.730 --> 02:13.070
I suppose I will prepare
another present for the new king.

02:30.460 --> 02:32.470
THAT TIME I GOT REINCARNATED AS A SLIME

03:44.580 --> 03:48.500
KINGDOM OF FALMUTH, EDMARIS VISCOUNTY

03:49.040 --> 03:51.870
EPISODE 57: SEVEN DAYS CLERGY'S CONSPIRACY
I was worried when I heard

03:51.870 --> 03:54.010
EPISODE 57: SEVEN DAYS CLERGY'S CONSPIRACY
Demon Lord Rimuru was siding with Youm.

03:54.010 --> 03:57.150
But Lubelius's Three Battlesages
of the Master Rooks...

03:57.150 --> 03:59.490
To think that the Champions
whose strength is second

03:59.490 --> 04:01.510
only to Saint Hinata
would come to my aid...

04:01.510 --> 04:05.730
And I heard Hinata herself
was off to slay Demon Lord Rimuru.

04:05.730 --> 04:08.520
It appears the heavens
have not forsaken me.

04:09.230 --> 04:13.770
The only problem was to find a just cause
to move my army to Nidol.

04:13.770 --> 04:20.780
But thanks to Earl Nidol's request for help
from the Eastern merchant...

04:20.780 --> 04:22.490
Not only that,

04:22.490 --> 04:27.290
he even provided me with a team
that specialized in hunting demons.

04:27.850 --> 04:30.670
All my problems have been solved!

04:31.380 --> 04:34.500
We will now attack the enemy!

04:34.500 --> 04:37.780
Our target is at Nidol's domain,
the traitor Youm!

04:38.170 --> 04:39.180
Gaston!

04:39.180 --> 04:40.260
Yes, my lord?

04:40.260 --> 04:44.970
Lead five thousand of our advance squad
and attack the town Youm is hiding at!

04:44.970 --> 04:46.310
Y-Yes, my lord!

04:46.710 --> 04:50.060
Then take my right-hand man,
Grigori, with you.

04:50.060 --> 04:54.650
Falmuth had lost many of its soldiers
from the battle with Demon Lord Rimuru.

04:54.650 --> 04:57.110
I'm sure he'll prove useful to you.

04:57.110 --> 04:59.820
Oh, how very assuring!

04:59.820 --> 05:02.950
You have my gratitude, Sir Saare.

05:04.490 --> 05:08.700
Hey, Saare, are you telling me
to babysit these simpletons?

05:08.700 --> 05:10.580
It's just a front.

05:10.580 --> 05:13.460
Your real target is the demon
who's said to kill Reyhiem.

05:13.460 --> 05:14.420
What?

05:14.420 --> 05:17.880
According to the rumors,
he's with Youm as reinforcement.

05:17.880 --> 05:19.920
I want you to go there
and lure him out.

05:19.920 --> 05:22.800
But if he's not there,
get back here immediately.

05:23.740 --> 05:25.870
I see! Got that!

05:39.690 --> 05:42.240
Damrada ran away, didn't he?

05:43.200 --> 05:46.200
Hired demon hunters, huh?

05:46.670 --> 05:50.200
Well, I can just sacrifice them,
if needed.

05:56.880 --> 05:58.750
Unforgivable.

05:58.750 --> 06:02.170
You embarrassed me
in front of Great Rimuru.

06:02.170 --> 06:05.470
If I'm relieved from my duties...

06:05.470 --> 06:09.180
If Great Rimuru tells me to go away...

06:09.180 --> 06:11.430
Just thinking of it makes me tremble.

06:12.480 --> 06:17.730
I will surely make you pay for
making me feel such horror.

06:22.000 --> 06:23.280
There he is.

06:23.280 --> 06:25.240
The new king Edward, and...

06:25.240 --> 06:28.910
Hmm, some who stood out of the crowd.

06:30.870 --> 06:33.370
Part of the Ten Great Saints, perhaps?

06:34.330 --> 06:35.420
Sir Hakuro.

06:35.420 --> 06:39.500
I have found one standout
among them headed your way.

06:39.500 --> 06:42.420
He should keep Sir Ranga occupied,
I would imagine.

06:42.830 --> 06:44.090
Roger that.

06:44.090 --> 06:46.010
Is it better not to kill him?

06:46.010 --> 06:46.950
Yes.

06:46.950 --> 06:50.310
I believe he is related to Lubelius,
the origin of those rumors against me.

06:50.310 --> 06:53.560
I wish to have him captured alive
and use him for our negotiations.

06:53.560 --> 06:56.230
Very well.
I will inform as such.

06:56.230 --> 06:57.560
Also...

06:57.560 --> 07:00.400
This target is leading
approximately five thousand troops.

07:00.400 --> 07:01.320
Perfect, then.

07:01.320 --> 07:04.070
Let's point Gobta and Gabiru at them.

07:04.650 --> 07:08.910
I will be watching them as well,
so feel free to do whatever you like.

07:08.910 --> 07:11.330
Don't take it too far.

07:11.330 --> 07:13.330
Understood.

07:21.630 --> 07:23.800
Hello, everyone.

07:23.800 --> 07:26.180
My name is Diablo.

07:26.180 --> 07:30.100
As for King Edward, I believe we've met
during the peace agreement.

07:30.100 --> 07:31.640
Take defensive positions!

07:31.640 --> 07:33.220
Protect King Edward!

07:33.610 --> 07:34.850
Hey, is that...

07:34.850 --> 07:36.040
Enemy attack?!

07:37.100 --> 07:40.480
Oh, they must be reporters
from the world's nations.

07:42.020 --> 07:45.150
I have no intention
to harm any of you.

07:45.150 --> 07:47.490
Just stay over there and watch.

07:47.490 --> 07:51.700
Sorry, Grigori.
The target came here by himself.

07:51.700 --> 07:55.080
Well, well. If it isn't the envoy of
Demon Lord Rimuru.

07:55.080 --> 07:57.750
May I ask what brings you here today?

07:59.290 --> 08:01.590
Oh, just to give you a warning.

08:01.590 --> 08:05.510
Send your troops back immediately
and make peace with Sir Youm.

08:05.510 --> 08:10.510
Then you will not have to taste a fear
you would much rather not know about.

08:12.190 --> 08:14.520
What a strange proposal!

08:14.520 --> 08:16.680
This is our nation's problem.

08:16.680 --> 08:19.600
There is no need for a demon
to meddle in our affairs.

08:19.600 --> 08:22.020
Hmph, I was almost tricked myself!

08:22.570 --> 08:24.020
Meaning?

08:24.020 --> 08:25.150
Enough playing dumb!

08:25.150 --> 08:29.070
You're conspiring with my brother,
no, Edmaris, and other con men

08:29.070 --> 08:32.990
to charge us for double
the reparations, are you not?

08:32.990 --> 08:35.750
Don't think I haven't seen through
your little schemes!

08:37.250 --> 08:39.110
Nothing to defend yourself with, is there?

08:39.110 --> 08:40.710
He might call himself a Demon Lord,

08:40.710 --> 08:43.010
but this Rimuru fellow
is as shallow as one can get.

08:43.010 --> 08:44.800
He's greedy for money
and seeks to spread

08:44.800 --> 08:46.760
the seeds of war across the land,
is he not?

08:48.880 --> 08:51.220
But what a pity, isn't it?

08:51.220 --> 08:53.930
You may have killed Archbishop Reyhiem
to silence him,

08:53.930 --> 08:57.390
but your misdeeds
are recorded right here!

09:00.850 --> 09:03.020
I had no intention of betraying you!

09:03.020 --> 09:05.980
Please, please forgive me!

09:07.490 --> 09:11.030
And what does this
piece of evidence prove?

09:11.030 --> 09:12.570
Don't you see?

09:12.570 --> 09:16.620
Lady Glenda over there
brought this to us.

09:17.120 --> 09:21.460
You infiltrated Lubelius
and killed Sir Reyhiem, did you not?

09:21.920 --> 09:24.840
You might feel relieved
after threatening him,

09:24.840 --> 09:28.960
but his faith outclassed your terror!

09:31.300 --> 09:33.470
How impressive.

09:33.470 --> 09:37.600
A mere human being able
to overcome his fear of me?

09:37.600 --> 09:40.020
That's a rather funny joke.

09:40.020 --> 09:41.130
Don't dodge the question!

09:41.130 --> 09:44.100
We have all the evidence against you.
You can't talk your way out of—

09:44.100 --> 09:46.360
That's enough. Silence.

09:47.070 --> 09:48.650
Enough of this charade.

09:48.650 --> 09:52.490
I cannot enjoy a battle of wits with
someone as simple-minded as you.

09:53.660 --> 09:54.950
Very well.

09:54.950 --> 09:57.830
Then how about we do a little test?

09:57.830 --> 10:02.250
To see if humans are truly able to
overcome their fear of me.

10:02.250 --> 10:04.710
Wh-What are you saying?

10:04.710 --> 10:09.510
If anybody here is able to
overcome their fear of me,

10:09.510 --> 10:11.550
I'll admit my defeat.

10:12.130 --> 10:14.840
But let me warn you...

10:14.840 --> 10:19.100
I have never lost to anyone before.

10:19.100 --> 10:23.640
Be prepared to face the consequences
of slandering the great Rimuru.

10:24.900 --> 10:28.400
Do it! Kill him at once,
demon hunters!

10:29.400 --> 10:32.440
Overcome our fear of you?
Don't make us laugh!

10:32.440 --> 10:35.700
A mere Arch Demon
is nothing rare in our homeland!

10:37.910 --> 10:41.700
Anti-demon strategies have been
researched to death in the East!

10:41.700 --> 10:43.870
Don't you underestimate us humans!

10:43.870 --> 10:46.330
Have you made your preparations?

10:46.330 --> 10:50.090
If you're ready, just give me
the starting signal.

10:50.420 --> 10:53.470
What? Are you saying you
purposely let us restrain you?

10:53.880 --> 10:56.090
Yes, of course.

10:56.090 --> 10:58.970
You are clearly putting
a lot of effort into this.

10:58.970 --> 11:00.310
You demon!

11:00.310 --> 11:03.270
You shall regret your arrogance
in the afterlife!

11:03.270 --> 11:04.440
Be vanquished!

11:04.440 --> 11:06.440
Thunderbolt!

11:11.230 --> 11:12.360
How about that!

11:12.360 --> 11:15.820
What does natural, non-magicule-infused
lightning taste like to you?!

11:15.820 --> 11:19.740
Once we destroy your body,
there is nothing you can do!

11:19.740 --> 11:24.000
Wonderful! They are truly
the Champions of the East!

11:24.000 --> 11:27.250
I must raise my reward for that merchant.

11:27.730 --> 11:30.340
"There is nothing you can do," huh.

11:30.340 --> 11:32.250
Let's see if it's really that easy.

11:34.630 --> 11:35.760
Weak!

11:35.760 --> 11:37.930
You're all far too weak!

11:40.430 --> 11:42.770
The lighting should've hit him directly!

11:46.020 --> 11:47.560
What a disappointment.

11:48.270 --> 11:50.900
Why didn't the lightning work on you?!

11:51.400 --> 11:53.320
Because it's weak.

11:53.320 --> 11:57.660
I am equipped with a strong resistance
to natural influences.

11:57.660 --> 11:59.820
Y-You monster...

12:00.300 --> 12:01.650
Now, then...

12:01.650 --> 12:03.700
Let's begin the test.

12:13.920 --> 12:15.170
Get away!

12:15.170 --> 12:16.590
H-Help me!

12:17.010 --> 12:20.470
What happened? It doesn't look like
that demon is doing anything.

12:20.890 --> 12:23.810
Dammit! What is this pressure?!

12:23.810 --> 12:25.140
Oh, my.

12:25.140 --> 12:28.390
Only three of you passed the test?

12:28.390 --> 12:29.350
What?!

12:29.900 --> 12:32.020
That's Three Battlesages for you...

12:32.020 --> 12:34.070
With these two on hand...

12:34.070 --> 12:36.990
I suppose you three deserve praise.

12:36.990 --> 12:41.320
Although I was holding back,
you withstand my Lord's Ambition.

12:42.320 --> 12:44.830
I'm not falling for your bluff, you demon!

12:45.330 --> 12:47.120
A bluff, you say?

12:47.120 --> 12:51.170
Only Demon Lord-class monsters
can wield Lord's Ambition!

12:51.170 --> 12:53.920
With Arch Demon being
the final evolution of the demon races,

12:53.920 --> 12:56.340
it is impossible for you
to become a Demon Lord!

12:56.840 --> 13:02.850
We demons indeed have
a limit in our energy amount.

13:02.850 --> 13:06.770
However, it is possible
to evolve to the next level.

13:07.310 --> 13:09.850
When the right conditions are met,
that is.

13:09.850 --> 13:10.850
Huh?

13:10.850 --> 13:13.360
I believe you people know about him.

13:13.900 --> 13:16.780
The Demon Lord known as the Red.

13:18.860 --> 13:23.370
And just obtaining the requirement
to become a Demon Lord is simple.

13:23.370 --> 13:26.080
All it takes is for one of us
to build our strength up to

13:26.080 --> 13:29.080
the maximum level, then live
for at least two thousand years.

13:29.080 --> 13:31.250
One hardly needs to even work for it.

13:32.220 --> 13:37.630
Perhaps the White would be more famous
in the East, where you came from?

13:37.630 --> 13:41.880
I observed her using Lord's Ambition
over there just the other day.

13:41.880 --> 13:44.640
Are you talking about
the Bloody Shore incident?!

13:47.770 --> 13:49.270
Impossible!

13:49.270 --> 13:54.190
No low-ranked demon would call
the name Red and White so casually!

13:54.190 --> 13:56.130
That can't be possible!

13:56.570 --> 13:59.900
That means... this guy is...

14:00.490 --> 14:03.490
Th-That is, that is...
That is possible!

14:03.490 --> 14:05.990
How could this happen?!

14:05.990 --> 14:09.410
There's just no way for us to win!

14:10.580 --> 14:12.120
Please help me!

14:12.120 --> 14:14.000
I beg you, at least spare my life!

14:14.580 --> 14:19.670
Oh, my. You passed the test,
so why don't we have some more fun?

14:19.670 --> 14:23.220
P-Please forgive me!
I only came here for the money!

14:23.220 --> 14:25.470
Please! Anything for my life!

14:25.470 --> 14:27.710
You may leave, then.

14:27.710 --> 14:29.560
Take those bodies away while you're at it.

14:29.560 --> 14:30.680
Y-Yes, sir!

14:31.600 --> 14:34.850
Hmm, you're pretty impressive.

14:43.780 --> 14:47.990
I find it hard to believe you're merely
a Calamity-level Arch Demon.

14:48.490 --> 14:50.870
Are you not going to run away?

14:50.870 --> 14:53.500
Run away? Such an amusing remark.

14:56.710 --> 14:58.670
My name is Saare.

14:58.670 --> 15:03.550
I'm one of the Three Battlesages
and the Ten Great Saints of Lubelius.

15:03.930 --> 15:04.800
Oh?

15:05.180 --> 15:08.350
So, who are you?

15:08.350 --> 15:10.350
I'm Diablo.

15:10.350 --> 15:14.520
I am the loyal butler of
the great and powerful lord Rimuru.

15:14.520 --> 15:17.350
You still aren't going
to reveal your identity?

15:18.740 --> 15:22.110
I'll make you regret your arrogance!

15:22.110 --> 15:24.860
You better not think of me
like those civilians!

15:24.860 --> 15:28.200
We're on a different level, tasked with
guarding the god Luminus herself!

15:31.910 --> 15:34.540
You were acting all pretentious
by mentioning Red and White,

15:34.540 --> 15:36.540
but what's there to be afraid of?!

15:36.540 --> 15:40.420
If you aren't going to reveal yourself,
then I just have to beat you into it!

15:48.640 --> 15:50.640
Reveal myself?

15:50.640 --> 15:55.520
Indeed, as you say,
I am not an Arch Demon.

15:55.520 --> 15:58.190
I've evolved to Demon Peer.

15:58.190 --> 16:02.190
It may not be all that different,
but do try to remember the difference.

16:03.690 --> 16:05.610
Demon Peer?!

16:09.490 --> 16:11.620
Demon Peer?!

16:11.620 --> 16:15.250
That stuff of legend said to possibly
even surpass average Demon Lords?!

16:16.120 --> 16:19.250
So that's what's happening here?!

16:19.250 --> 16:23.130
Dammit! Just what the heck is
Demon Lord Rimuru thinking?!

16:23.130 --> 16:25.550
How could he give this guy
out of all people a name!

16:25.550 --> 16:28.510
What are you balking for?!
Let's take this guy down now!

16:28.510 --> 16:29.890
Grenda, wait! That guy is—

16:32.390 --> 16:34.470
Heh! Not as impressive
as you claim to be, eh?

16:36.640 --> 16:38.350
Oh, right.

16:38.350 --> 16:43.150
I forgot to mention this,
but physical attacks do not work on me.

16:45.230 --> 16:46.490
There's no other choice.

16:58.500 --> 17:01.710
Dammit! That was a slash from
a Unique weapon, Demonslayer!

17:01.710 --> 17:05.840
Glenda, buy me some time
so I can use my Holy magic to...

17:06.490 --> 17:07.590
Hey, Glenda?

17:08.630 --> 17:11.180
Your female companion is over there.

17:11.180 --> 17:12.300
Huh?!

17:12.300 --> 17:14.970
Grenda, you coward!

17:14.970 --> 17:17.220
I'll do this! I can do this!

17:17.220 --> 17:20.020
I'll hold him off until Grigori returns!

17:20.020 --> 17:22.520
NIDOL MIGAM EARLDOM, YOUM'S HEADQUARTERS

17:36.950 --> 17:38.660
Th-This wolf...

17:38.660 --> 17:40.790
Sir Grigori, your orders?

17:41.290 --> 17:45.650
Looks like now's not the time
to worry about the demon.

17:50.970 --> 17:53.050
A-A wolf is flying!

17:53.050 --> 17:55.600
S-Sir Grigori, you orders?

17:55.600 --> 17:56.680
Hell if I know.

17:56.680 --> 17:57.350
What?

17:57.350 --> 18:01.520
General Gaston, you tackle
the approaching forces.

18:01.890 --> 18:04.060
You can see them
advancing from there, right?

18:04.810 --> 18:06.570
V-Very well.

18:06.570 --> 18:08.780
What about you, Sir Grigori?

18:10.990 --> 18:13.280
I'll take that guy on!

18:13.280 --> 18:15.320
Python, Garcia.

18:15.320 --> 18:16.990
You two protect our general—

18:19.370 --> 18:20.580
Dammit!

18:28.340 --> 18:31.090
Tch, you stupid dog!

18:33.590 --> 18:37.850
Oooh! It's coming!
Sir Grigori, your orders?!

18:38.600 --> 18:40.350
Impervious!

18:42.600 --> 18:44.980
Ranga, you're too fast...

18:44.980 --> 18:49.020
Indeed. I fear there won't be
much left for us to do.

18:49.020 --> 18:52.320
My brother, please, enough whining
and continue the chase.

18:52.700 --> 18:54.650
We're going now!

18:54.650 --> 18:55.950
Got it!

19:06.120 --> 19:07.040
Huh?

19:09.590 --> 19:11.300
Sir Grigori...

19:11.760 --> 19:14.970
Whoa! That's not good, Ranga!

19:14.970 --> 19:16.890
He's gonna die
if you do any more of that!

19:16.890 --> 19:18.930
Oh, no! We have to treat him at once!

19:18.930 --> 19:20.010
Hmm?

19:20.010 --> 19:22.810
But doesn't this human
wish to play more?

19:22.810 --> 19:25.190
No, no, no! I don't think so!

19:25.190 --> 19:30.190
No, indeed! If you don't stop now,
Great Rimuru will scold you!

19:30.690 --> 19:32.190
That'd be bad.

19:34.070 --> 19:36.780
If you retreat your troops now,
we will not pursue you.

19:36.780 --> 19:37.700
What is it gonna be?

19:39.240 --> 19:41.620
Retreat! Retreat!

19:43.370 --> 19:47.080
We're supposed to beat them?!
How could we possibly do that?!

19:53.000 --> 19:54.130
Hurry...

19:54.130 --> 19:56.880
Hurry up and come back, Grigori!

20:00.390 --> 20:02.470
I can't face him all alone!

20:04.180 --> 20:07.560
Put in more effort and show me
an interesting skill or two.

20:07.560 --> 20:08.810
Damn it!

20:11.570 --> 20:14.610
A sure-kill strike powered
with your own aura imbued

20:14.610 --> 20:17.530
with the element your
opponent is weak against.

20:23.540 --> 20:28.330
But if I just analyze its structure
and disassemble it

20:28.330 --> 20:30.420
before you could activate it...

20:37.420 --> 20:39.550
There will be no miracles.

20:40.550 --> 20:41.640
You absurd!

20:48.440 --> 20:50.020
I get it now.

20:50.020 --> 20:53.690
He can kill me anytime he wants,
but he chooses not to.

20:53.690 --> 20:55.730
That means he has
no intention of killing me.

20:56.080 --> 20:59.000
There's no reason for a monster
stronger than Demon Lord Valentine

20:59.000 --> 21:01.910
to go out of his way to kill Reyhiem.

21:01.910 --> 21:04.620
Which means this demon
is not the one who did it!

21:05.240 --> 21:06.750
That's right!

21:06.750 --> 21:10.560
Hinata said we shouldn't
interfere with this matter,

21:10.560 --> 21:13.920
but the Archbishop was killed right
after she left, as if someone timed it.

21:13.920 --> 21:15.130
That means...

21:16.630 --> 21:19.090
The one who killed Reyhiem was...

21:19.090 --> 21:22.010
Saare, we've come to aid you.

21:22.010 --> 21:25.890
Rejoice. We shall destroy
this demon together.

21:27.810 --> 21:30.390
S-Seven Days Clergy!

21:30.990 --> 21:33.400
Oh, so that's them?

21:33.400 --> 21:35.440
Hold the demon back for us.

21:35.440 --> 21:37.900
We will take care of him with our magic.

21:39.990 --> 21:42.780
Cleaning up the evidence, I suppose?

21:45.080 --> 21:46.030
Oh no!

21:46.030 --> 21:48.200
Everyone, run!

22:03.090 --> 22:04.680
Hey, are you okay?!

22:16.190 --> 22:18.400
My Full Potion is not working?!

22:18.400 --> 22:19.360
Answer.

22:19.360 --> 22:23.930
The individual Hinata Sakaguchi appears
to have a high magic resistance.

22:23.930 --> 22:26.080
Her body automatically
disassembles magicules,

22:26.080 --> 22:27.780
neutralizing their effects.

22:28.150 --> 22:32.040
O-Only Holy magic
would work on Lady Hinata!

22:32.040 --> 22:34.290
What did you say?
Don't just stand there then!

22:34.290 --> 22:36.210
Cast some magic
that works on her! Hurry!

22:36.210 --> 22:37.790
Litus! Cast her your healing magic!

22:37.790 --> 22:39.050
C-Coming!

22:45.050 --> 22:46.890
Demon Lord Rimuru.

22:46.890 --> 22:49.430
It is a pleasure to meet you.

22:49.430 --> 22:52.930
We are members of the Seven Days Clergy.

22:55.690 --> 23:02.780
We have come here to punish
Hinata Sakaguchi for violating our orders.

24:36.500 --> 24:39.420
Next time, "God and Demon Lord."
